OL,3,GNEWSACherries fans hail historic day in
OL,4,ASan Sebastian
OL,5,
OL,6,FCherries fans are gathering in San
OL,7,FSebastian ahead of their club's first
OL,8,FEuropean fixture.
OL,10,FAFC Bournemouth take on Real Sociedad
OL,11,Fon Thursday night in the UEFA Europa
OL,12,FLeague and excited supporters have been
OL,13,Fsharing what the moment means to them.
OL,15,FAfter a lifetime of supporting the
OL,16,Fclub, which 30 years ago was on the
OL,17,Fbrink of financial collapse, many say
OL,18,Fthey can hardly believe their luck.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
