OL,3,GNEWSACherries fans hail historic day in
OL,4,ASan Sebastian
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmong them is Liam Baker, from
OL,7,FBournemouth, who said: "I wouldn't miss
OL,8,Fit for the world. This is a
OL,9,Fonce-in-a-lifetime opportunity for me,
OL,10,Fand for everyone. It's unbelievable to
OL,11,Fbe here."
